abstract: >-
  Official simulation suite, Ulam transfer-operator discretization solvers,
  statistical linear-response verification, precomputed Monte Carlo datasets,
  and figure reproduction scripts for the paper 'Autonomous Neural Adaptive
  Control as a Self-Consistent Transfer Operator' by Stefano Galatolo and
  Vittorio Lippi (submitted to Journal of Nonlinear Science).
